#NEXUS

[ serrano-brañas2016a_fig11: Ornithomimosaur strict consensus. One polytomy: Struthiomimus, Ornithomimus, Sinornithomimus, Tototlmimus and (Gallimimus, Anserimimus) on one vertical, as the caption says. Character numbers and state boxes along the branches are not encoded. 12 tips, 1 polytomies (5 children). Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=12;
    TAXLABELS
        Allosaurus
        Tyrannosaurids
        Pelecanimimus
        Harpymimus
        Garudimimus
        Archaeornithomimus
        Struthiomimus
        Ornithomimus
        Sinornithomimus
        Tototlmimus
        Gallimimus
        Anserimimus
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE 'serrano-brañas2016a_fig11' = [&R] (Allosaurus,(Tyrannosaurids,(Pelecanimimus,(Harpymimus,(Garudimimus,(Archaeornithomimus,(Struthiomimus,Ornithomimus,Sinornithomimus,Tototlmimus,(Gallimimus,Anserimimus))))))));
END;
